<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 18.012 Thunder &amp; Lightning</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Capps, Jerry: Amer Gemcutter, May 96, p29</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Indexing rotated 10 index settings to make design</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">match diagram in reference.  Preform added. </text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">39 facets + 7 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.012  T/W = 0.550  U/W = 0.466</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.358 C/W = 0.105</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.129</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="410">pc18012.asc</tspan>
</text>
